      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹2.49 (down from ₹2.88 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹5.05b (down 2.3% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹541.2m (down 14% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 11% (down from 12% in 3Q 2025). Revenue is forecast to grow 10% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 8.3% growth forecast for the Media industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 4% per year whereas the company’s share price has fallen by 2% per year.",
